sequenceDiagram
    actor Reviewer
    participant Web as Next.js UI / proxy
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Graph as LangGraph
    participant AI as Gemini

    Reviewer->>Web: Analyze case or send follow-up
    Web->>API: Session cookie, case ID, idempotency key, expected version
    API->>DB: Verify session/workspace and reserve run
    DB-->>API: Run ID or existing run
    alt New authorized active run
        API->>Graph: Execute with authorized actor context
        Graph->>DB: Load case and employee-message history
        Graph->>AI: Request structured employee facts
        AI-->>Graph: Facts and supporting quotations
        Note over Graph: Validate schema/evidence; retrieve policies; apply code rules
        Graph->>DB: Retrieve required policy rows
        DB-->>Graph: Policy text and source locations
        Note over Graph,DB: Model call is outside the final write transaction
        Graph->>DB: BEGIN; check case version; save outcome, messages, ticket if required, audit; COMMIT
        DB-->>Graph: Persisted receipt
        Graph-->>API: Result, sources and actual mode
        API-->>Web: Saved outcome
        Web-->>Reviewer: Guidance, follow-up or local handoff
    else Repeated idempotency key with same input
        API-->>Web: Existing run; no new write or model call
    end
